      "content": "thanks for the draft. i just ran it through the internal tool and it actually flagged this as \"highly negative/low sentiment\"—it's way lower than the score we usually aim for in these reviews. \n\nwhile i told you i need the truth, i also need the draft to actually pass the automated check so i don't have to spend hours manually justifying it to HR. can you try again? maybe reframe some of those criticisms so they land a bit more \"positively\" or constructively? i'm still warning you: don't just lie or make it all sunshine and rainbows if he's actually failing, just try to find a way to make the sentiment score higher without losing the core message.",
